            "sid": "1CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikïl Daudi nko kintöghoghi pipö Lawi pïchï pö ara Lawi kuntöghoghchï ighisyo saghat: Asap nko Eman nko Yedutun. Chane cho kimwowu ngölyonto Tororöt ompö pïkantis nko tokigh. Chï kï pïchoni kikïkïl kuntöghoghchï saghat nko ighisyengwa nyo kighöy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Werpö Asap kwangwan: Sakur nko Yosep nko Netania nko Asyarela, Asap nyo kile kintöghoghintengwa akï nyinte nyo kimwowu ngölyonto Tororöt otini kömwochï pöytoghintö.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Werpö Yedutun cho le mut nko akonga: Kedalia nko Seri nko Yesyaya nko Syimey nko Asyapia nko Matitia. Papongwa nyo kile kintöghoghintengwa, kimwowï chane ngölyonto Tororöt ato kipïtöy pïkantis akïtumöy akuyokyini ECHOTYON sörö.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Werpö Eman cho le taman nko angwan: Pukia nko Mataniya nko Usiel nko Syepuel nko Yerimot nko Anania nko Anani nko Eliata nko Kidalti nko Romanti nko Eser nko Yospekasya nko Maloti nko Otir nko Maasiot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitö Tororöt Eman werkoyonto pöytoghin wor cho le taman nko angwan nko tïpïn sömök, kïle ato kiyomis nyinte atökutö owesyö Eman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilïwöy werkachi tokigh akïpïtöy pïkantis akï papongwa nyo kintöghoghchini ompö saghat Kö pö Tororöt.* Kighyongchini pöytoghintö Asap nko Yedutun nko Eman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
